{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@E@MLNTextWritingMode@MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration Case","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placement would be laid out horizontally.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placement would be laid out horizontally.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The property allows control over a symbol’s orientation. Note that the property","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values act as a hint, so that a symbol whose language doesn’t support the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provided orientation will be laid out in its natural orientation. Example:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"English point symbol will be rendered horizontally even if array value contains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single ‘vertical’ enum value. The order of elements in an array define priority","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order for the placement of an orientation variant.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingMode","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode","title":"MLNTextWritingMode","type":"topic"}}}